      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 675126785,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Is `file_get_compression()` intended to be:\n\n- a static routine within file_wrappers.c;\n- a routine for use only inside libwiretap;\n- a routine for use outside libwiretap?\n\nIf it's the first of those, it should be made `static`.\n\nIf it's the third of those, it should be exported with `WS_DLL_PUBLIC` and added to debian/libwiretap0.symbols.\n\nIf it's the second of those, all is well.\n\nIt should perhaps also be named `file_get_compression_type()`.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
