          "id": 675202896,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "So is `wtap_get_compression_type()` supposed to be:\n\n* a routine for use only inside libwiretap;\n* a routine for use outside libwiretap?\n\nIf it's the first of those, all is well.\n\nIf it's the second of those, it should be exported with `WS_DLL_PUBLIC` and added to debian/libwiretap0.symbols.",
