          "id": 675220448,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It's for use outside wiretap, but it's already exported with [WS_DLL_PUBLIC](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/wiretap/wtap.h#L1780-L1781) and added to [debian/libwiretap0.symbols](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/debian/libwiretap0.symbols#L138) and has been since your commit ba3454529302a64e11c498a2185f4b5ddc1ccf3a. This just updates the existing exported function to be able to return something other than `WTAP_GZIP_COMPRESSED` or `WTAP_UNCOMPRESSED`.",
